# Generated settings-UI output, written by scripts/sync-settings-ui.mjs from
# packages/settings-ui/{public,dist}. `/settings/script.js` has been ignored
# since long before its siblings; these two join it because settings/index.html
# already referenced an untracked script.js, so nothing new depends on them
# being present in a checkout that has not built.
#
# settings/tokens.css is deliberately NOT here: .stylelintrc.cjs reads it as the
# token vocabulary for `lint:css`, which runs before any build.
#
# The widget bundles (widgets/*/public/index.{js,css}) are NOT ignored, and must
# not be: each widget's index.html is tracked and references ./index.css and
# ./index.js, and `homey app build`/`publish` preprocess the source tree
# directly without running our build scripts. Untracking them would silently
# package five widgets with no styles and no browser code.
/settings/index.html
/settings/script.js
/settings/style.css
/test/screenshots/*.png
/packages/settings-ui/test/screenshots/*.png
/output/
/tmp/
# Legacy eslint config (we use eslint.config.mjs flat config)
.eslintrc.json

